From 3f58bff351bd12377470ee2b65f6dbc1938a8207 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adrien Delmas <adrien@adriendelmas.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 09:23:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 130/144] hydra: viewport preview through mixes; translator
 comments in English

The preview translator followed a mix_color's `color1`, a socket the node
no longer has: a mixed texture never reached the viewport, which showed
the 0.8 default. Mixes now follow the side their factor favours, then the
other; math and vector_math both operands; a mix of two constants is
computed from the values and the Sdr defaults (K-42). The translator's
comments, in French, are now in English like the rest of the code.
---
